    "distinct_tunes_practiced": "How many different tunes does a person practice each week?",
    "practice_time_by_platform": "How long do people practice, on each platform?",
    "free_tier_pressure": "How soon do people reach the free storage limit?",
    "friction_and_churn": "Do failed uploads, syncs, and exports drive people away?",
